    <item>
      <title>my dearest alisha, my sweetest lily</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/lily/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 04:57:18 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/lily/</guid>
      <description>I hope today you stopped to feel the wind on your skin. I hope you paused, even for a moment—to feel the sunlight, to take a breath between chapters of the rush of your days. I hope you know that even in the midst of chaos, the world holds moments meant only for you. I love you. Though we live in places so far apart that even the seasons seem out of sync, I still feel you close to me.</description>
